  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide an emergency response and timely assistance to urgent or chronic humanitarian needs of people affected by natural disaster or conflict</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Provide an emergency response and timely assistance to urgent or chronic humanitarian needs of people affected by natural disaster or conflict is a component of Support for Conflict Affected People and Peacebuilding reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;2,200,000. It works in the following sector(s): Food assistance, Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Democratic participation and civil society, Civilian peace-building, conflict prevention and resolution, Basic health care, Education facilities and training.</narrative>
  </description>
